# Helium atom
System He.xyz
Method HF
Basis cc-pVDZ
Direct false
IntegralThresh 1e-14
Guess Core
# Converge well below the density comparison tolerance of chkcompare
# (1e-6): at the default threshold, the run-to-run density noise has a
# tail that occasionally crosses it
ConvThr 1e-9


Logfile He_dz.log
SaveChk He_dz.chk
BasisRotate false
